  text="JAXA announces that MMX launched on H3 flight No. 10 at 04:41:03 Japan time on 20 October 2026 (19:41 UTC on 19 October) from the Tanegashima Space Center. The rocket flew as planned; the spacecraft separated 71 minutes 13 seconds after liftoff and was placed in its planned orbit. The release gives no Mars arrival date.",
